# Apple-copyrighted firmware blobs — not redistributable, must not enter
# a public release. Currently tracked in this working repo (see
# docs/release_audit.md Sev-1); this entry is forward-looking prep for
# the fresh no-history publish and has no effect on already-tracked
# files. See files/README.md (to be added at publish time) for
# provenance, expected checksums, and where to source your own copy.
files/420dbff3.rom
files/342s0440-b.bin
files/pmuv2.bin

# ── 2026-09-12 pre-publication sweep ────────────────────────────────────────
# COPYRIGHTED FIRMWARE — never track these. They are Apple's, not ours:
#   files/420dbff3.rom    Quadra 700 ROM (1 MB)
#   files/pmuv2.bin       PMU firmware ("Copyright Apple Computer Inc 1987-1990")
#   files/342s0440-b.bin  ADB modem ROM
# They were stripped from history on 2026-09-12. Supply your own dumps, exactly
# as MAME requires you to; see README.md ("ROMs you must supply").
files/*.rom
files/342s0440-b.bin
files/pmuv2.bin
*.rom
# Generated from the user's ADB dump, never a redistributable RTL source.
/rtl/mac/adb_pic_fw.hex
*.bit
*.ltx
*.dcp
*.mcs
*.prm

